item.content:encoded:
I saw this on one of the social sites the other day, but I can&rsquo;t remember which (or who shared it)&hellip;
&ldquo;Wasting time&rdquo; might be one of the strangest accusations we&rsquo;ve ever invented. Apparently you can waste 2:00 p.m. by sitting under a tree doing nothing.
The afternoon was going to pass either way. The Earth was going to rotate either way. But because you didn&rsquo;t convert those hours into money, errands or improvement, we decided the time itself was wasted.
